@baseUrl = http://localhost:5270

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Identity module
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/ping

### OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json


### Register - success
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@playtesthub.dev",
  "password": "Parola123!",
  "displayName": "First Tester"
}

### Register - same email again (expect 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@playtesthub.dev",
  "password": "Parola123!",
  "displayName": "Duplicate"
}

### Register - invalid data (expect 400 with field errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "123",
  "displayName": ""
}




### Login - saves the token for the next requests
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@playtesthub.dev",
  "password": "Parola123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### Login - wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@playtesthub.dev",
  "password": "WrongPassword1!"
}

### Current user (run Login first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Current user without token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/me